  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a scion of discordia gains a 1st-level variable recitation slot.</p>\n<p>Whenever she apologizes to the universe to reset the Law of Finite Malleability each day, she chooses a 1st-level recitation she does not know whose prerequisites she meets. She now knows the chosen recitation. The next time she apologizes to the universe to reset the Law of Finite Malleability, she loses all knowledge of the chosen recitation.</p>\n<p>At 11th level, a scion of discordia gains a 2nd-level variable recitation slot, and, at 17th level, she gains a 3rd-level variable recitation slot. These function just like a 1st-level slot, save they let the scion learn recitations of a higher level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/scion-of-discordia#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
